# Shell scripts must stay LF regardless of the checkout platform's core.autocrlf setting:
# a CRLF .sh breaks the shebang on macOS/Linux. Relaypublisher's own publish flow normalizes
# CRLF/CR to LF for macOS Scripts.PreInstall/PostInstall content before upload
# (doc/01-manifest-schema.md §5.4.2), but samples are also meant to be copied as-is.
*.sh text eol=lf
